      "source": "Annotation that can be applied to a test class to configure a test <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/CacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>CacheManager</code></a>\nif none has been defined yet. By default this annotation installs a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/NoOpCacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>NoOpCacheManager</code></a>.",
      "translation": "可应用于测试类以配置测试<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/CacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache\"><code>CacheManager</code></a>（如果尚未定义）的注解。默认情况下，此注解会安装一个<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.x/javadoc-api/org/springframework/cache/support/NoOpCacheManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.cache.support\"><code>NoOpCacheManager</code></a>。",
